OL,3,GNEWSA'Sir Chris Hoy talking about
OL,4,Acancer saved my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA keen cyclist who was diagnosed with
OL,7,Fprostate cancer after seeing Sir Chris
OL,8,FHoy talk about his own terminal
OL,9,Fdiagnosis has joined a charity ride
OL,10,Forganised by the six-time Olympic
OL,11,Fchampion.
OL,13,FDave Maybrick, from Oxford, was
OL,14,Fdiagnosed with the disease two years
OL,15,Fago following a PSA test he requested
OL,16,Fafter being moved by hearing Sir
OL,17,FChris's story.
