OL,3,GNEWSA'Sir Chris Hoy talking about
OL,4,Acancer saved my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn October 2024, the Team GB icon
OL,7,Frevealed he had been told by doctors
OL,8,Fthat his prostate cancer had spread to
OL,9,Fhis bones, giving him between two and
OL,10,Ffour years to live.
OL,12,FMaybrick, 55, recently joined his
OL,13,Fcycling hero at his Tour de 4 event,
OL,14,Fwhich aims to change perspectives on
OL,15,Fstage four cancer and raise money for
OL,16,Fcancer charities.
